th:0px\">Description<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After taking over the NWSL license at the beginning of the year, Panini continues its releases for the top-tier women\u2019s soccer league in the US with a Prizm Black collection. Following the Donruss Optic Cards, this is the second Optichrome release for the National Women\u2019s Soccer League.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Collectors can especially look forward to the popular Colorblast, Manga and Stained Glass inserts, which feature NWSL stars for the first time. Other inserts already announced include Center Stage, Drip and Connections.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fans can also look forward to 2 autograph cards featuring the league\u2019s stars in every box.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\" style=\"margin-top:1.5em;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0.5em;margin-left:0;font-size:19px\">Availability<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Each Hobby box from the collection contains 50 cards, divided across 10 packs with 5 cards each. According to Panini America, these always include 2 autograph cards.<\/p>\n\n\n<p>A specific release date has not yet been announced and will be added here once confirmed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From that point onward, the boxes will be available from Panini America\u2019s online shop or from retailers specializing in sportscards.<\/p>\n\n\n<h2 id=\"products\" class=\"wp-block-heading sac-output-heading sac-output-heading--products\">Products<\/h2><div class=\"sac-product-list\"><div class=\"sac-product-item\"><div class=\"sac-product-inner\"><div class=\"sac-product-image\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.collectosk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/soccer\/2026\/2026-panini-prizm-black-nwsl\/2026-panini-prizm-black-nwsl-soccer-cards-hobby-box.avif\" data-lbwps-lightbox><picture>\n\t\t\t\t\t<source type=\"image\/avif\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.collectosk.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/soccer\/2026\/2026-panini